<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: "'Source Han Sans SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif", flexDirection: 'column' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 120, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0B3C6E' }}>数据库与常见问题</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8A94A6' }}>第三章 · 原理与支持</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 540 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 340, height: 540, backgroundColor: '#0B3C6E', padding: '40px 30px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>五库分工<br />各司其职</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.8)', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>检索走对应库，识别精度与速度兼得；高频问题先查右侧速查表，多数一分钟内可自行解决。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 940, height: 540, paddingLeft: 40, paddingTop: 20, paddingRight: 60, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 460, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0B3C6E' }}>五个衍射数据库</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333333', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>· COD 无机库：物相鉴定的主力检索库<br />· COD 索引库：峰位快速检索（精简索引）<br />· PDF2-2004：经典卡片库（需正版授权，仅本地）<br />· 内置矿物库：常见矿物的优先快速通道<br />· 用户自建库：导入自定义 CIF 持续积累</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 360, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
          <Image src="assets/09_database_manager.png" style={{ width: 340, height: 237, objectFit: 'contain', border: '1px solid #C5D5E8', borderRadius: 8 }} />
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0B3C6E', marginTop: 4 }}>高频 FAQ</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333333', lineHeight: 1.55 }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2F8F4E' }}>外部引擎红灯 →</span> 「数据库→外部程序」手动指定路径后点「验证」，或点「检测」自动定位。<br /><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2F8F4E' }}>鉴定结果为空 →</span> 先确认已扣背景；峰少于 5 个时放宽信噪比阈值。<br /><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2F8F4E' }}>窗口布局乱了 →</span> v0.15 起损坏的旧布局会自动作废重建；也可删除 ~/.polyxrd 下布局配置重置。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A94A6' }}>PolyXRD v0.15.0 使用手册</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A94A6' }}>13 / 14</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
